#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gametype:"
msgstr "Vrsta igre:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategy, Dice"
msgstr "Strategija, Kocka"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of possible players:"
msgstr "Broj mogučih igrača:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Two</para>"
msgstr "<para>Dva</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kjumpingcube; is a simple tactical game. You can play it against the "
"computer or a friend - or you can set up a game between two computer players "
"and just watch."
msgstr ""
"&kjumpingcube; je jednostavna taktička igra. Možete je igrati protiv "
"računara ili prijatelja-ili možete namjestiti igru između dva igrača na "
"računaru i samo gledati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That can be a good idea if you have not played &kjumpingcube; before. See "
"<link linkend=\"faq\">Frequently asked questions</link>, <quote>How do I get "
"started in this game?</quote>."
msgstr ""
"To može biti dobra ideja ako niste igrali  &kjumpingcube; prije. Pogledaj "
"<link linkend=\"faq\">Frequently asked questions</link>, <quote> Kako početi "
"igrati igru?</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The playing area is a box of cubes containing points. When the game starts "
"each cube has one point, no owner and a neutral color. If you click on a "
"neutral cube it becomes yours, changes to your color and increases by one "
"point. Your objective is to capture all the cubes, but now it is your "
"opponent's turn."
msgstr ""
"Područje igre je kutija koja sadrži kocke s poenima. Kad počne igra svaka "
"kocka noci jedan poen, nema vlasnika i neutralne je boje. Ako kliknes na "
"neutralnu kocku ona postaje tvoja, mjenja boju u tvoju i i raste za jedan "
"poen, Tvoj cilj jeste da da osvojiš sve kocke, ali sad je red na tvog "
"protivnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Players move and add points by clicking on neutral cubes or their own cubes."
msgstr ""
"Igrači pomjeraju i dodaju poene klikanjem na neutralne kocke ili na njihove "
"kocke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The only way to capture your opponent's cubes is to increase a cube's value "
"until it reaches a maximum and expands into neighboring cubes. Then those "
"cubes become yours, even if they belonged to your opponent before."
msgstr ""
"Jedini način da osvojiš kocke svog protivnika jeste da povećate vrijednost "
"kocki dok ne dostignu maximum i prošire se na susjedove kocke. Tada te kocke "
"postaju tvoje, iako su pripadale tvoj protivniku prije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes a neighbor will also reach a maximum value and expand and a "
"cascade of moves will spread across the board. Large numbers of cubes can "
"suddenly change hands and this is where &kjumpingcube; becomes interesting "
"and challenging."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad susjed će također dostići maximalnu vrijednost i širit će se s nizom "
"poteza po tabli. Velik broj kocki može iznenada promijeniti vlasnika i to je "
"gdje &kjumpingcube; postaje interesantna i izazovna."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Objektiv:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Take over all the cubes on the game board."
msgstr "Preuzmi sve kocke na tabli igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kjumpingcube; loads directly into game mode, so you can start playing right "
"away. If Player 1 is a computer player, you must click to get started."
msgstr ""
"&kjumpingcube; ulazi direktno u način igre, tako da možete odmah početi da "
"igrate. Ako je Igrač1 kompjuterski igrač, vi morate kliknuti start da bi "
"počela igra."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have not played &kjumpingcube; before, try watching a game or two "
"where the computer plays against itself. See <link linkend=\"faq"
"\">Frequently asked questions</link>, <quote>How do I get started in this "
"game?</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste prije igrali &kjumpingcube; prije svega, pogledajte partiju ili "
"dvije gdje kompjuter igra sam protiv sebe. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"faq\"> "
"Uobičajena pitanja </link>, <quote> Kako počinjem igru?</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You move by clicking on a neutral cube or one you already own. If you click "
"on a neutral cube, you gain ownership over it and the cube’s color changes "
"to your playing color. Each time you click on a cube, the value of the cube "
"increases by one. If the cube's value reaches a maximum, some of its points "
"move to the cube’s immediate neighbors (the points <quote>jump</quote> "
"around). If a neighboring cube happens to be owned by the other player, it "
"is captured, together with all of its points, and changes to your playing "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Krećete se tako što klikate na neutralnu kocku ili na onu koju već "
"posjedujete. Ako kliknete na neutralnu kocku, dobijate vlasništvo nad tom "
"kockom i kocka mijenja boju u boju vaših kocki. Svaki put kada kliknete na "
"kocku, vrijednost kocke se poveća za jedan poen. Ako vrijednost kocke "
"dostigne maximum, neki od poena prelaze na neposrednu susjednu kocku (the "
"points <quote>jump</quote>around). Ako je susjedna kocka u vlasništu "
"protivnika, uhvaćena je sa svim poenima, i mijenja se u boju u vašu boju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Primjer:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a cube in the centre reaches five points, four of its points go to its "
"four neighbors leaving the source cube with one point. It is possible to "
"start a cascade of automatic moves if any of the neighbors cubes also "
"reaches a maximum."
msgstr ""
"Ako kocka u centru dostigne pet poena, četiri poena od tog idu tvom susjedu "
"ostavljajući izvornu kocku s jednim poenom. Moguće je početi niz automatskih "
"poteza ako neka od susjedovih kocki dostigne također maximum."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Napomena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Large parts of the playing area can change hands very rapidly. You can use "
"animation settings to help you follow what is happening then. See the <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for more details."
msgstr ""
"Veliki dijelovi igrališta mogu mijenjati igrače vrlo brzo. Možete koristiti "
"postavke animacije da vam pomognu da pratite šta se dešava. Vidite <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\"> konfiguracija Igre</link> odjeljak za više "
"detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "The winner is the player who ends up owning all the cubes on the board."
msgstr "Pobjednik je igrač koji završi kao vlasnik svih kocki."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A move consists of clicking on a cube that does not belong to your opponent."
msgstr ""
"Potez se sastoji od klikanja na kocku koja ne pripada vašem protivniku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "The move increases the points in the cube by one."
msgstr "Potez povećava vrijednost kocke za jedan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the start of the game, each cube has one point, is painted in a neutral "
"color and has no owner."
msgstr ""
"Na početku igre, svaka kugla nosi jedan poen, ofarbana je u neutralnu boju i "
"nema vlasnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each player has a color to mark the ownership of cubes."
msgstr "Svaki igrač ima boju da obilježi vlasništvo kugle."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking a cube that has no owner, the player becomes the owner of that "
"cube and it changes its color to the player's color. Simultaneously the "
"cube’s value is increased by one."
msgstr ""
"Klikanjem na kocku koja nema vlasnika, igrač postaje vlasnik te kocke i "
"mijenja boju u boju tog igrača. Istovremeno kocka povećava vrijednost za "
"jedan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a cube has more points than it has neighbors, one point jumps to each of "
"the neighbors."
msgstr ""
"Ako kocka ima više poena nego što ima susjed, jedan poen prelazi na svaku od "
"susjednih."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"During such a move, all the neighboring cubes become owned by the player who "
"moved and so do all of their points, even if the neighbors were neutral or "
"owned by the other player."
msgstr ""
"Tijekom takvog poteza, sve susjedne kocke postaju vlasništvo igrača koji je "
"pomjerio i svi njihovi poeni, iako su susjedne kocke bile neutralne ili u "
"vlasništvu drugog igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Neighbors are the cubes located above, below, at left or at right, but not "
"diagonally. Corner cubes have two neighbors, edge cubes have three and "
"center cubes have four."
msgstr ""
"Susjedne kocke su locirane iznad, ispod, lijevo i desno, ali ne i "
"dijagonalno. Kocke u uglu imaju dvije, kocke na rubu imaju tri i kocke u "
"centru imaju četiri susjedne kocke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a move leaves a neighbor with a maximum number of points, the move "
"continues automatically to the neighbor's neighbors and so on, in a cascade. "
"A large number of cubes can change ownership during such a move."
msgstr ""
"Ako potez ostavlja na susjednu kocku maximalni broj poena, potez se "
"automatski nastavlja na susjednu kocku susjedne i tako dalje, u nizu. Veliki "
"broj kocki može promijeniti vlasnika u toku ovakvog poteza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "The winner is the player who ends up owning all the cubes."
msgstr "Pobjednik je igrač koji završi kao vlasnik svih kocki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use settings to select board size, computer players, move animations "
"and players' colors. Each computer player can have its own style and skill "
"level. If not playing, it can provide hints to the corresponding human "
"player. You can also pit one computer player against another and watch the "
"outcome. See the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> "
"section for more details."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti postavke za postavljanje veličine igrališta, igrače "
"računara, animacije poteza i boje igrača. Svaki računarski igrač može imati "
"svoj stil i nivo vještine. Ako ne igra, to može da pruži savjete "
"odgovarajučem ljudskom igraču. Možete također staviti jednog igrača računala "
"protiv drugog i gledati ishod. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"configuration"
"\">Game Configuration</link>odjeljak za više detalja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It may help to set up a computer v. computer game and select the check boxes "
"in the settings dialog that let you step through moves and animations at "
"your own pace. See <link linkend=\"faq\">Frequently asked questions</link>, "
"<quote>How do I get started in this game?</quote> and <quote>That was too "
"fast for me, how can I slow it down?</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Može pomoći ako namjestite igrač računala protiv igrača računala i "
"selektujte kutije provjeravanja u postavkama koje vam korak po koraki vode "
"kroz poteze i animacije vašim valstitim tempom. Vidite  <link linkend=\"faq"
"\"> Uobičajna pitanja</link>,<quote> Kako počinjem ovu igru?</quote> i "
"<quote>To je bilo prebrzo za mene, kako mogu ovo usporiti?</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a cube which is right next to an opponent's cube, try to stay "
"ahead by increasing before your opponent does."
msgstr ""
"Ako imaš kocku koja je desno od protivničke kocke, pokušaj ostati ispred "
"povečavajući poene prije svog protivnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If such a cube's points are less than or equal to the opponent's, try to "
"avoid increasing: you cannot win that arms race."
msgstr ""
"Ako su poeni te kocke manji ili jednaki kocki od protivnika, izbjegavajte "
"povečavanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Look for opportunities to increase and capture, but beware of your opponent "
"being able to reply by starting a cascade."
msgstr ""
"Tražite mogućnosti da povećate i osvojite, ali budite pažljivi vaš protivnik "
"može da odgovori tako što će početi niz."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to get control of the corner cubes first, then the edge cubes. You need "
"fewer moves to make them reach a maximum and expand."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte da kontrolišete kocke u uglu prvo, onda kocke na rubu. Treba vam "
"manje poteza da postignete maximalan broj poena i da se širite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try not to play too close to your opponent, especially during the opening "
"moves. Drop back a cube or two or pick a cube on the diagonal from your "
"opponent."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte da ne igrate preblizu svog protivnika, posebno na početku igre. "
"Propustite kocku ili dvije ili izaberite kocku dijagonalno od vašeg "
"protivnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep an eye out for long chains of cubes that are almost at their maximum. "
"If they are yours, you must guard them against cascading moves. If they are "
"your opponent's, they can become ripe for capture by a cascading move, just "
"as soon as they are close enough to your territory."
msgstr ""
"Obratite pažnju na dugi lanac kocki koji su skoro dostigle svoj maximum. Ako "
"su one vaše, morate ih čuvati od niza poteza. Ako su one od vašeg "
"protivnika, one mogu se mogu osvajati nizom poteza, u onom trenutku kad su "
"dovoljno blizu vašem teritoriju.,."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "Pregled interfejsa"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Toolbar"
msgstr "Alatna linija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Stop/Start Button"
msgstr "Stop/Start Dugme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This large button appears at the top left of the toolbar and is used to "
"provide control over animations and computer moves, especially if the "
"computer has the first move, is playing against itself or is taking too long "
"to move. The button can also be used for stepping through a game or a move, "
"to let beginning players view each step at their own pace. Check boxes in "
"the settings dialog turn the step mode on or off (see the <link linkend="
"\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for more details)."
msgstr ""
"Veliko dugme se pojavljuje na u lijevom čošku na vrhu alatne trake i daje "
"kontroli nad animacijama i računarskim potezima, posebno ako računar ima "
"prvi potez, ako igra protiv samog sebe ili uzima previše vremena za potez. "
"Dugme se može također koristiti za prolazak kroz igru ili potez,."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "The button has three states:"
msgstr "Tipka ima tri stanja:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Red</term>"
msgstr "<term>Crvena</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to stop or interrupt a computer calculation, an animation or "
"a computer v. computer game."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je stopirati ili prekinuti kompjuterske kalkulacije, animaciju ili "
"igru kompjeter v. kompjuter."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Zeleno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to start or continue a computer move, an animation or a "
"computer v. computer game."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je stopirati ili prekinuti kompjuterske kalkulacije, animaciju ili "
"igru kompjeter v. kompjuter."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Plavo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The button is disabled and a human action is expected, such as making the "
"next move."
msgstr ""
"Dugme je onesposobljeno i ljudska reakcija se očekuje, kao što je slijedeći "
"potez."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In each case, the button contains some text to indicate what action can be "
"done or is expected, such as <guibutton>Stop animation</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Your turn</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"U svakom slučaju, dugme sadrži tekst koji indicira koja akcija se može "
"poduzeti ili šta se može očekivati, kao  <guibutton> Zaustavi animaciju </"
"guibutton> ili <guibutton> Tvoj red </guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you stop the calculation of a computer move, the computer will pick the "
"best move it has so far. If you interrupt an animation (&eg; a cascade that "
"is taking too long), the move will proceed to its conclusion immediately."
msgstr ""
"Ako možes zaustaviti kalkulaciju računarskog poteza, računar će učiniti "
"najbolji potez koji ima u dosadašnjem toku. Ako prekinete animaciju  (&eg; a "
"cascade that is taking too long), potez će nastaviti zaključak automatski."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard Toolbar Buttons"
msgstr "Standardna Dugmad Alatne linije"

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A shortcut to enter the settings dialog and change playing conditions. See "
"the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"Kratica za ulazak u postavke dialoga i mijenjane uslova igre. Pogledajte "
"<link linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija Igre</link> dio za više "
"detalja."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guiicon>New</guiicon>"
msgstr "<guiicon>Nova</guiicon>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:204 index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start a new game."
msgstr "Počnite novu igru."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Pokreni"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:207 index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load a previously saved game."
msgstr "Pokreni prethodno sačuvanu igru."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sačuvaj"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:210 index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save the current game."
msgstr "Sačuvaj trenutnu igru."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hint"
msgstr "Savjet"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:213 index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Get a hint as to the best move to make next. The hint is calculated by "
"computer player 1 or 2, depending on whether you are human player 1 or 2. "
"See the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Savjet za najbolji slijedeći potez. Savjet je iskalkulisan po računarskom "
"igraču 1 ili 2, zavisno od tog da li je ljudski igrač 1 ili 2. Pogledajte "
"<link linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija Igre </link>dio za više "
"detalja."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Poništi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216 index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Undo a previous move, repeatedly if required. </action> Note: It is "
"possible to undo the closing moves of a completed game and investigate "
"alternative endings."
msgstr ""
"<action>Poništi prethodni potez, u više navrata kao je potrebno.</action> "
"Zabilješka: Moguće je poništiti završni potez i istražiti dodatne načine "
"završavanja."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Redo"
msgstr "Preurediti"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:221 index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "Redo a move that was undone, repeatedly if required."
msgstr "Preuredi potez koji je poništen, u više navrata ko je potrebno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "Stavke izbornika"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Game Menu"
msgstr "Izbornik Igre"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Load...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pokreni...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sačuvaj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snimi kao...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save the current game with a different name."
msgstr "Sačuvaj trenutnu igru s drugim imenom."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Završi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quit</action> &kjumpingcube;."
msgstr "<action>Završi</action> &kjumpingcube;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Move Menu"
msgstr "Izbornik Poteza"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu><guimenuitem>Poništi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preuredi</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Savjet</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other Menus"
msgstr "Drugi Izbornici"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kjumpingcube; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings"
"\">Settings Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-"
"help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kjumpingcube; ima zajedničko &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> Stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"dio sa <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Postavke "
"Izbornika</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Izbornik Pomoći</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Uobičajna pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim promijeniti izgled igre. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently you can only change the player's colors, but not the game theme. "
"To change the player's colors use the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game "
"Configuration</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno možete samo promijeniti boju igrača, ali ne i podlogu igre. Da "
"promijenite boju igrača koristite <link linkend=\"configuration"
"\">Konfiguracija Igre</link> dialog."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I get started in this game?"
msgstr "Kako da počnem ovu igru?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The moves of &kjumpingcube; can be hard to follow at first. One way to learn "
"is to watch games where the computer plays against itself. Use the <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> dialog to set it up. "
"Check both <guilabel>Playing now</guilabel> boxes, choose a board size in "
"the range 3x3 to 5x5, set the animation to <guilabel>Scatter dots</guilabel> "
"and the move-time to <guilabel>Long</guilabel>, then click <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>. Now click the big green button in the toolbar to start the game."
msgstr ""
"Potezi kjumpingcube; mogu biti teški za pratiti na početku. Jedan način da "
"naučite jeste da gledate kada računar igra sam protiv sebe. Koristite <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija Igre</link> dijaloški prozor da to "
"postavite. Označite  <guilabel>Igra u toku</guilabel> kućice, izaberite "
"veličinu table u okviru 3X3 do 5X5, postavite animaciju <guilabel>Scatter "
"tačkice</guilabel>  i vrijeme poteza <guilabel>Dugo</guilabel>,onda "
"kliknite<guibutton>OK</guibutton>. Sada kliknite veliko zeleno dugme u na "
"alatnoj liniji za početak igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "That was too fast for me, how can I slow it down?"
msgstr "Ovo je bilo prebrzo za za mene, kako ga mogu usporiti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> dialog "
"again. Down at the bottom are two check boxes. Check one to pause the game "
"between moves. Check the other to pause between steps of cascade moves that "
"spread out over the board, especially near the end of the game. Back in the "
"game, you can now use the big toolbar button (whenever it goes green), to "
"trigger off each move or proceed step by step within a move, at whatever "
"pace you choose."
msgstr ""
"Koristite <link linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija Igre</link> "
"dijaloški opet. U dnu imate dva potvrdna okvira. Provjerite jedan u pauzi "
"između poteza. Provjerite drugi u pauzi između kaskadnih poteza, posebno "
"pred kraj igre. Povratak u igru, sada možete koristiti dugme sa alatne "
"trake  (kad god pozeleni), da potaknete svaki potez ili da nastavite korak "
"po korak, bez obzira na tempo koji ste izabrali."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "What does the big button in the toolbar do?"
msgstr "Šta veliko dugme u alatnoj traci radi?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This button is used to stop something the computer is doing (red color), "
"start or continue a computer action when you are ready (green color) or "
"prompt you to do something, such as make a move (blue color, button "
"disabled). For a full description see <link linkend=\"stop_start_button"
"\">The Stop/Start Button</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo dugme se koristi da se zaustavi nešto što računar radi (crvena boja), "
"početi ili nastaviti računarsku akciju kad ste vi spremni (zelena boja) ili "
"brzovremeno obavijestiti šta da radite, kao da napravite potez ( plava boja, "
"dugme isključeno). Za puni opis pogledajte <link linkend=\"stop_start_button"
"\">Stop/Start Dugme</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje ove igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kjumpingcube; cannot be played using the keyboard."
msgstr "No.&kjumpingcube;  ne može se igrati pomoću tastature."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the high scores?"
msgstr "Gdje se nalaze najbolji rezultati?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kjumpingcube; does not have such a feature."
msgstr "&kjumpingcube; nema listu najboljih rezultata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open the configuration dialog use the menubar option: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kjumpingcube;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> On Apple Mac OS X use option: "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>&kjumpingcube;</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Or you can use the Settings button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Da otvorite konfiguraciju koristite izbornu traku  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriraj&kjumpingcube;...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> On Apple Mac OS X use option: <menuchoice><guimenu>&kjumpingcube;"
"</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ili možete "
"koristiti dugme Postavki u alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kjumpingcube; Settings</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kjumpingcube; Postavke</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kjumpingcube; Settings</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kjumpingcube; Postavke</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Cascade Move Display and Cascade Move Time panels control the optional "
"animation display when a cube reaches its maximum and spills over into "
"neighboring cubes, possibly starting an extended cascade of moves. It is "
"easiest at first to use the <quote>Scatter dots</quote> animation and a long "
"move time. That is the best way to follow the progress of cascade moves. The "
"two Pause check boxes let you step through animations and computer moves at "
"your own pace."
msgstr ""
"Displej Kaskadnihn Poteza i Ploča Vremana Kaskadnih Poteza kontroliše "
"animacije displeja kad kocka dostigne maximum i preljeva na susjedove kocke, "
"s mogučnošću starta produženog kaskadnog poteza. Na početku lakše je da se "
"koristi <quote>Scatter tačkice</quote> animacije i više vremena za potez. To "
"je najbolji način da se prati napredak kaskadnog poteza. Dvije potvrdne "
"kutije dozvoljavaju vam da prođete kroz animacije i računarske poteze u svom "
"tempu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Computer Player 1 and 2 panels control the style and level of each "
"computer player's play and whether that player should actually play or just "
"provide hints to human player 1 or 2."
msgstr ""
"Računarski igrači 1 i 2 kontrolišu stil i level svakog računarskog igrača i "
"određuju da li taj igrač treba ustvari da igra ili samo da savjetuje "
"ljudskoh igrača 1 ili 2."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Details of Settings"
msgstr "Detalji Postavki"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Playing now"
msgstr "Igra u toku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets Computer Player 1 or 2 to be actively playing or just assisting a human "
"player with hints. Normally you would set the computer to play one player "
"and you would play the other, but you can have two human players or two "
"computer players and just watch. Player 1 always starts first."
msgstr ""
"Postavite Računarskog Igrača 1 ili 2 da igra aktivno ili da samo asistira "
"ljudskom igraču sa savjetima. Normalno postavit ćete računar da bude jedan "
"igrač a vi ćete biti drugi, ali vi možete imati dva ljudska igrača ili dva "
"računarska i samo posmatrati. Igrač 1 uvijek počinje prvi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Style of Play"
msgstr "Način Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets Computer Player 1 or 2 to play as Kepler or Newton. Kepler chooses "
"moves by the same method as earlier versions of &kjumpingcube;. Newton uses "
"a different method."
msgstr ""
"Postavite Računarskog igrača 1 ili 2 da igra kao Kepler ili Newton. Kepler "
"bira poteze istom metodom kao u prethodnoj verziji od &kjumpingcube; Newton "
"koristi drugačiji metod."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Computer Skill"
msgstr "Vještine Računara"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Lets you choose a computer player's playing skill from a slider.</"
"action> This decides how clever the computer opponent will be."
msgstr ""
"<action> Dozvoljava vam da birate vještine računarskog igrača sa klizača.</"
"action> Ovo odlučuje koliko će biti pametan protivnik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose any of five levels, ranging from <guilabel>Beginner</"
"guilabel>, through <guilabel>Average</guilabel> to <guilabel>Expert</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete da birate bilo koji od pet levela, rangiranih od <guilabel>Početnik</"
"guilabel>, kroz <guilabel>Prosječan</guilabel> do<guilabel>Ekspert</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Board Size"
msgstr "Veličina Table"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you choose the size of the play area."
msgstr "Dozoljava vam da birate veličinu igrališta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the slider to select a value between <guilabel>3x3</guilabel> cubes and "
"<guilabel>15x15</guilabel> cubes. The range 5x5 to 9x9 is the most "
"convenient. Below 5x5 it is very hard to beat the computer. Above 9x9 games "
"can become rather long."
msgstr ""
"Koristite klizač da izaberete veličine između  <guilabel>3x3</guilabel> "
"kocke i <guilabel>15x15</guilabel> kocke. Opseg od 5x5 do 9x9 je "
"najprikladniji. Ispod 5X5 je jako teško pobijediti računar. Iznad 9X9 može "
"biti predugo."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Players' Colors"
msgstr "Boje Igrača"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose a color for each player and for the neutral cubes."
msgstr "Izaberi boju svakog odigrača i za neutralne kocke."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cascade Move Display"
msgstr "Displej Kaskadnih Poteza"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose an animation style for when a cube reaches its maximum and expands "
"into neighboring cubes, possibly starting a cascade of such moves and "
"covering a large area of the board."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite animaciju za za kockino maximalno dostizanje poena i širenje na "
"susjedove kocke, mogućnost početka kaskade iz takvih poteza i pokrivanje "
"velikog dijela table."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the radio buttons to select from <quote>None (no pauses)</quote>, where "
"the whole move is displayed instantaneously; <quote>Darken and pause</"
"quote>, where each overloaded cube darkens until it is time for it to "
"expand; <quote>Blink rapidly</quote>, where each overloaded cube darkens at "
"first and then blinks rapidly when it is time for it to expand and "
"<quote>Scatter dots</quote>, where each overloaded cube darkens at first and "
"then fires dots into neighboring cubes when it is time for it to expand."
msgstr ""
"Koristite radio dugme za korištenje iz  <quote>Ništa (no pauses)</quote>, "
"gdje je cijeli potez prikazan trenutno;<quote>Potamnjeti i pauzirati</"
"quote>, gdje svaka preopterećena kocka potamni dok nije vrijeme za širenje;"
"<quote>Svjetlucati brzo</quote>, gdje svaka preopterečena kocka potamni na "
"početku a onda svjetluca brzo kad je vrijeme za širenje i  <quote>Scatter "
"tačkice</quote>, gdje svaka preopterečena kocka potamni na početku a ona "
"ispaljuje tačkice na susjedove kocke kad je vrijeme za širenje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cascade Move Time"
msgstr "Vrijeme Kaskadnog Poteza"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the slider to select from a range of times (Short to Long) to be spent "
"on animations. The times depend a little on the type of animation, but can "
"range from 0.15 seconds to 1.5 seconds for each stage of a cascade move."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti klizač da odredite opseg vremena (Kratko ili Dugo) koji će "
"da bude potrošen na animaciju. Vrijeme zavisi malo od vrste animacije, ali "
"može se kretato od 0.15 sekundi do 1.5 sekundi za svaku fazu kaskadnog "
"poteza."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause before each computer move"
msgstr "Pauza prije bilo kojeg računarskog poteza"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this check box is selected, computer players will pause before they start "
"a move, until you click to resume. This is to help you follow the action, "
"especially if you are a new player or studying a computer versus computer "
"game."
msgstr ""
"Ako je potvrdna kutija selektovana, račuarski igrači će pauzirati prije nego "
"što počnu potez, dok vi ne kliknete na nastavak. Ovo je da lakse pratite, "
"posebno ako ste novi igrač ili učite kroz računar protiv računara."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pause before each cascade step"
msgstr "Pauza prije svakog kaskadnog poteza"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this check box is selected, the animation of cascade moves will pause "
"between steps, until you click to resume. This is to help you observe such a "
"move as it spreads out over the board."
msgstr ""
"Ako je potvrdna kutija selektovana, animacija kaskadnog poteza će pauzitati "
"između, dok vi ne kliknete nastavi. Ovo će vam pomoći da posmatrate što više "
"poteza kad se šire preko table."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits and License"
msgstr "Zasluge i Licenca"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kjumpingcube; is Copyright 2012, 2013 Ian Wadham and Copyright 1998, 1999 "
"&Matthias.Kiefer; &Matthias.Kiefer.mail;"
msgstr ""
"&kjumpingcube; je Autorsko pravo 2012, 2013 Ian Wadham i Autorsko  1998, "
"1999 &Matthias.Kiefer; &Matthias.Kiefer.mail;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kjumpingcube; was inspired by a game that came out for the Commodore 64 and "
"other early home computers. Unfortunately the original author's name is "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"&kjumpingcube; je bila inspirisana igrom koja je izdata na Commodore 64 i "
"ostalim ranim kućnim računarima. Nažalost orginalono ime autora je nepozato."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In 2007, Ian Wadham took over maintenance of &kjumpingcube; for &kde; 4 and "
"Eugene Trounev painted the first SVG theme."
msgstr ""
"U 2007,Ian Wadham je preuzeo održavanje &kjumpingcube; za &kde; 4 i Eugene "
"Trounev je naslikao prvu temu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In 2012 and 2013, Ian developed versions 2.0 and 2.1 of &kjumpingcube;, "
"adding the animation styles, allowing board sizes down to 3x3 or up to 15x15 "
"and writing completely new artificial intelligence modules that offer more "
"of a challenge to a human player. These versions calculate moves faster, add "
"multi-level undo/redo (previously only one move), add a choice of two AI "
"opponents and provide options for beginning players to step through "
"animations and computer moves."
msgstr ""
"U 2012 i 2013,Ian je razvio verziju 2.0 i 2.1 &kjumpingcube;dodavajući "
"animarajući stil, dozvoljavajući smanjenje table do 3X3 i povećanje do 15X15 "
"i napisao completan novi artikal modula umjetne inteligencije koji nude više "
"izazova za ljudskog igrača.Ove verzije zaračunaju poteze brže, dodaju multi-"
"level poništi/preuredi (pretodni potez), daju izbor između dva AI protivnika "
"i predviđa opcije za početniča korak po korak kroz animacije i računarske "
"poteze."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
